  "projects": [
    {
      "name": "Desk Studio",
      "summary": "A design studio inside the coding agent you already use. Ask for a launch card or a brand kit in plain words, and a small team of model desks makes it, scores it and signs it off.",
      "url": "https://github.com/adityareddy-dev/deskstudio",
      "demo": "https://deskstudio.ai",
      "stats": {
        "npmVersion": "1.0.3",
        "firstPublished": "2026-10-19",
        "githubStars": 41,
        "license": "MIT"
      },
      "highlights": [
        "A Claude Code plugin, and one npx command for Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Copilot, Windsurf and OpenCode.",
        "Each job is routed by cost: three roughs on Sonnet, the pick on Opus, polish on Haiku, then a proof step with no model at all.",
        "Every job leaves a note with who did what, the scores and the cost. A chart costs under a dollar, a full brand kit about ten.",
        "Runs on your machine through the CLI you're already signed in to.",
        "The studio designed its own brand kit, which is either a good sign or a conflict of interest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "react-inp-blame",
      "summary": "When a click, tap or key press in your React app is slow, this names the component or the handler behind it and says where the time went.",
      "url": "https://github.com/adityareddy-dev/react-inp-blame",
      "demo": "https://reactinpblame.com/",
      "stats": {
        "npmVersion": "0.26.0",
        "npmReleases": 19,
        "firstPublished": "2026-09-17",
        "githubStars": 4,
        "mergedPullRequests": 49,
        "dependencies": 0,
        "license": "MIT"
      },
      "highlights": [
        "Which React component made this interaction slow. Joins Event Timing and Long Animation Frames to the React fiber tree.",
        "Writes a plain-language verdict for each slow click, tap or key press, and adds tracks to Chrome's Performance panel.",
        "Setups for Next.js 14.2 or later and Vite, plus React Router, Remix, TanStack Start and Astro.",
        "Zero dependencies.",
        "On four open-source apps, built with and without it, INP did not move on any of them.",
        "Everything in the demo is slow on purpose, which is the only time I will ever say that about my code."
      ]
    },
    {
